OL,4,CMillions of wives in South Asia        
OL,5,Cunprotected from marital rape - study  
OL,6,GFailure to fully criminalise marital   
OL,7,Grape leaves millions of women and      
OL,8,Ggirls unprotected in eight South Asian 
OL,9,Gcountries, where intimate partner      
OL,10,Gviolence is 35% higher than the global 
OL,11,Gaverage, says a new study.             
OL,13,FMore than 100 countries have outlawed  
OL,14,Fmarital rape, but a large part of      
OL,15,FSouth Asia - India, Afghanistan, Sri   
OL,16,FLanka and Bangladesh - remain among    
OL,17,Fthe three dozen countries which        
OL,18,Fhaven't.                               
